{"id":"donde","lemma":"donde","pos":"prep","rank":137,"glosses":["by, near to","round (at the house of), chez"],"ipa":"/donde/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/9/91/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Precision27-donde.wav","examples":[{"text":"Aquí es donde vivo.","en":"This is where I live.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/523494"},{"text":"Ahí es donde iremos.","en":"That's where we'll go.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/636802"},{"text":"Aquí es donde vivimos.","en":"This is where we live.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/462189"},{"text":"¿Donde estabas tú escondido?","en":"Where were you hiding?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/803628"},{"text":"Me quedé donde estaba.","en":"I remained where I was.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/275200"}]}